WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:17.290
A light in the yellow house blinked on, and Ben heard the sound of footsteps racing up the

2
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:21.553
stairs. A deep voice boomed, "What's wrong, son?

3
00:00:22.114 --> 00:00:22.854
Don't worry!

4
00:00:22.995 --> 00:00:23.935
Daddy's coming!"

5
00:00:24.876 --> 00:00:25.657
Ben gulped.

6
00:00:27.438 --> 00:00:29.000
"I'm going to be in big trouble!"

7
00:00:30.004 --> 00:00:34.727
Too scared to find out what would happen next, Ben shot back toward Monsterville as fast as he

8
00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:41.272
could. Several garbage cans near the fence had been knocked over.

9
00:00:46.015 --> 00:00:48.977
Ben flew over the fence and then stopped to catch his breath.

10
00:00:48.997 --> 00:00:52.800
"That was scary," thought Ben.

11
00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:55.722
"That little kid was so scared of me!

12
00:00:56.182 --> 00:00:58.064
I could have gotten in a lot of trouble!"

13
00:00:58.816 --> 00:01:01.978
Looking around, he realized Mog was nowhere in sight.

14
00:01:01.998 --> 00:01:04.739
"Mog!" called Ben.

15
00:01:04.759 --> 00:01:06.800
"Mog, where are you?"

16
00:01:07.701 --> 00:01:08.941
There was no answer.

17
00:01:08.961 --> 00:01:11.003
"Where did he go?"

18
00:01:11.563 --> 00:01:12.263
Ben murmured.

19
00:01:13.284 --> 00:01:17.846
Then he remembered the loud crashing sound and the garbage cans that had been knocked over.

20
00:01:21.228 --> 00:01:22.329
Could Mog have done that?

21
00:01:22.889 --> 00:01:24.830
Ben wondered about it as he flew home.

22
00:01:27.431 --> 00:01:30.690
A short while later, Ben slipped back into his bedroom.

23
00:01:32.071 --> 00:01:34.493
Sid was still snoring quietly in his bed.

24
00:01:38.116 --> 00:01:43.560
Ben climbed into his own bed, his heart still racing as he thought about his adventure in People

25
00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.402
Place. What if he'd been caught?

26
00:01:46.923 --> 00:01:48.524
He wasn't sure what would have happened.

27
00:01:49.605 --> 00:01:51.246
Maybe the people would have captured him.

28
00:01:52.347 --> 00:01:57.211
First thing in the morning, they probably would have marched him over to Monster Academy and into Mr.

29
00:01:57.251 --> 00:01:58.072
Freaky's office.

30
00:01:58.812 --> 00:02:04.038
Yikes! Ben shuddered and tried to go to sleep, but it wasn't easy.

31
00:02:06.541 --> 00:02:08.142
He tossed and turned all night.

32
00:02:10.525 --> 00:02:13.228
He couldn't stop thinking about the little kid he'd scared.

33
00:02:14.189 --> 00:02:16.011
And he couldn't stop thinking about Mog.

34
00:02:17.412 --> 00:02:20.456
"I knew I never should have trusted him," thought Ben.

35
00:02:27.436 --> 00:02:32.099
The next morning at school, Ben spotted Mog in the crowded hallway before homeroom.

36
00:02:33.499 --> 00:02:34.740
He stormed toward him.

37
00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:37.081
"Where did you go last night?"

38
00:02:37.522 --> 00:02:38.062
he called.

39
00:02:39.503 --> 00:02:44.545
To Ben's surprise, Mog shot a quick glance at Ben and then hurried off in the other direction.

40
00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:49.108
Ben narrowed his eyes at the monster.

41
00:02:49.128 --> 00:02:52.930
"Mog definitely knocked over those garbage cans.

42
00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.371
I'm sure he was just trying to get me in trouble!

43
00:02:56.564 --> 00:02:58.445
Well, he can't hide from me forever.

44
00:02:58.465 --> 00:03:01.425
He'll have to talk to me in cooking class."

45
00:03:02.786 --> 00:03:05.967
Ben went to homeroom and sat down, still fuming.

46
00:03:05.987 --> 00:03:09.588
"Attention, all monsters!"

47
00:03:10.068 --> 00:03:12.489
Mr. Freaky's voice crackled over the loudspeaker.

48
00:03:12.509 --> 00:03:16.830
"A very grave situation has come to my attention!"

49
00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:20.531
"Uh-oh!" Ben bolted upright, worried.

50
00:03:21.451 --> 00:03:23.672
But a ghost sitting next to Ben was laughing.

51
00:03:24.817 --> 00:03:26.658
"A 'grave' situation?

52
00:03:26.898 --> 00:03:30.760
Ha-ha! Maybe we're going to take a field trip to a graveyard!"

53
00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:34.963
"Oh, I love graveyards!"

54
00:03:35.523 --> 00:03:37.044
said a skeleton girl dreamily.

55
00:03:38.385 --> 00:03:40.006
Mr. Freaky was still talking.

56
00:03:40.026 --> 00:03:42.688
"First period is canceled this morning.

57
00:03:43.068 --> 00:03:46.570
Instead I want all students to report to the auditorium."

58
00:03:47.591 --> 00:03:49.012
Ben's thoughts were racing.

59
00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:50.700
Did Mr.

60
00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:53.942
Freaky know about his adventure in People Place the night before?

61
00:03:53.962 --> 00:03:59.584
Ben remembered that little kid and how scared he'd looked at the sight of a ghost.

62
00:04:00.885 --> 00:04:03.166
Why in the world had Ben listened to Mog?

63
00:04:04.266 --> 00:04:09.228
The bell rang just then, and monsters began to stream out of homerooms to make their way to

64
00:04:09.268 --> 00:04:10.129
the auditorium.

65
00:04:11.489 --> 00:04:14.551
Ben followed them and slunk into a seat next to Gaby.

66
00:04:14.571 --> 00:04:17.032
"Hey," he murmured.

67
00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:19.101
"I wonder what Mr.

68
00:04:19.141 --> 00:04:21.802
Freaky is going to talk about," said Gaby.

69
00:04:22.722 --> 00:04:24.503
Ben was too worried to respond.

70
00:04:25.484 --> 00:04:28.986
The principal walked up to the microphone, looking very serious.

71
00:04:29.006 --> 00:04:33.628
"I received a phone call this morning," said Mr.

72
00:04:33.668 --> 00:04:40.932
Freaky. "Apparently a ghost flew into People Place last night and scared a little child."

73
00:04:42.133 --> 00:04:44.614
A shocked rumble went through the auditorium.

74
00:04:44.634 --> 00:04:46.315
"A ghost?"

75
00:04:46.735 --> 00:04:47.756
said a fish monster.

76
00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.080
"In People Place?"

77
00:04:50.661 --> 00:04:52.081
said an octopus monster.

78
00:04:52.101 --> 00:04:54.522
"Scared a kid?"

79
00:04:55.123 --> 00:04:56.363
said a purple monster.

80
00:04:56.383 --> 00:04:58.104
"That's terrible!"

81
00:04:58.624 --> 00:04:59.324
said Gaby.

82
00:05:01.845 --> 00:05:04.426
Ben slid down in his chair, holding his breath.

83
00:05:04.446 --> 00:05:07.267
"Quiet!" shouted Mr.

84
00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:11.729
Freaky. Right away the entire auditorium fell silent.

85
00:05:11.749 --> 00:05:19.173
"Unfortunately the child who saw the ghost isn't just any child," said Mr.

86
00:05:19.233 --> 00:05:22.755
Freaky. "He's Mayor Hubbletree's son!"

87
00:05:23.916 --> 00:05:25.577
Ben almost slid off his chair.

88
00:05:26.358 --> 00:05:27.339
The mayor's son?

89
00:05:27.919 --> 00:05:31.261
Had Mog known that when he sent Ben to that house to look for the brooms?

90
00:05:32.923 --> 00:05:37.326
Ben saw Mog sitting in the next row, but the monster was looking the other way.

91
00:05:37.346 --> 00:05:40.808
"As many of you know," said Mr.

92
00:05:40.868 --> 00:05:45.272
Freaky, "Monster Academy was built on land owned by People Place."

93
00:05:47.572 --> 00:05:50.173
The principal looked at the floor and took a deep breath.

94
00:05:50.193 --> 00:05:58.337
"There's no easy way to say this, but Mayor Hubbletree has decided to evict us."

95
00:05:59.558 --> 00:06:01.859
A huge gasp filled the auditorium.

96
00:06:01.879 --> 00:06:07.662
"That means we must leave," said Mr.

97
00:06:07.722 --> 00:06:12.484
Freaky. "Monster Academy is going to be destroyed!"

98
00:06:13.948 --> 00:06:17.653
At first Ben had been afraid of getting in trouble for scaring the little boy.

99
00:06:18.794 --> 00:06:20.856
Now something much worse was happening.

100
00:06:21.817 --> 00:06:24.721
Mayor Hubbletree was planning to destroy Monster Academy.

101
00:06:25.722 --> 00:06:27.163
And it was all Ben's fault!
